     * @dev ERC1967-compliant transient storage slot key.
     *      Exact form: bytes32(uint256(keccak256(abi.encode("crane.access.reentrancy.lock"))) - 1).
     *      Follows LR-6 and gold standards (e.g. OperableRepo "crane.access.operable").
